Z||000012||mbramble||08-22-2001||05:06 PM||||Great!!  <P>FYI, the 'fuses' for both the power windows and power locks are should be the metal 30 circuit breaker types.  But, if you aren't blowing them regularly there is no problem.  If you should start to, I would replace them with the correct items...<BR>||||reg||1
